{"id":"maksimum","lemma":"максимум","pos":"adv","rank":2048,"glosses":["at most"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/64/Ru-%D0%BC%D0%B0%D0%BA%D1%81%D0%B8%D0%BC%D1%83%D0%BC.ogg/Ru-%D0%BC%D0%B0%D0%BA%D1%81%D0%B8%D0%BC%D1%83%D0%BC.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"У него максимум 100 долларов.","en":"He has at most 100 dollars.","words":[{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"he, it","l":"он"},null,null]},{"text":"Это максимум.","en":"That's the maximum.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null]},{"text":"Она заплатит максимум пятьдесят долларов.","en":"She will pay 50 dollars at most.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"to pay","l":"заплатить"},null,{"g":"fifty"},null]},{"text":"Он зарабатывает максимум пятьдесят долларов в неделю.","en":"At the most, he earns 50 dollars a week.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to earn","l":"зарабатывать"},null,{"g":"fifty"},null,{"g":"in"},null]},{"text":"Автобус может перевозить максимум сорок человек.","en":"The bus can carry a maximum of forty people.","words":[{"g":"bus, motorbus"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to transport"},null,{"g":"forty"},{"g":"person"}]}]}